# No unrequested screenshots or recordings

Do not take screenshots, record the screen, or create walkthrough videos unless the user explicitly asks for them in this conversation.

Do not use RecordScreen, save browser screenshots, or write walkthrough artifacts under `/opt/cursor/artifacts` as proof of work.

Verify with `pnpm validate`, `pnpm typecheck`, tests, logs, and curl. If a recording or screenshot is wanted, the user will say so.
